  "answer_text": "Here's some information about **\"Still in Love with You\"** by **Brooks & Dunn**:\n\n- \"Still in Love with You\" is a **1991 song** by Brooks & Dunn from the album ***Brand New Man***.\n\n- It is the **tenth track** on *Brand New Man*.\n\nThe song is a classic country heartbreak ballad about a man who has to say goodbye to the woman he loves but can't stop loving her no matter what. The chorus captures the emotion perfectly with the imagery of wishing he could escape \u2014 on a horse, on wings \u2014 but knowing he'd always wake up still in love with her.\n\nYou can listen to it on **Spotify** or find it on **YouTube**. It remains one of Brooks & Dunn's beloved deep cuts from their landmark debut album. \ud83c\udfb6\ud83e\udd20\n\nWould you like to know more about Brooks & Dunn or the *Brand New Man* album?",
